Description:

A JMAP Email/query that anchors its result window past the end of the
matching messages now returns an empty slice.  Previously a positive
anchorOffset was not clamped to the number of results, so the count of
remaining results was computed by subtracting a position beyond the end of
the set, wrapping around to a very large count and reading past the end of
the results.  The negative-offset side was already clamped.

Tracked as GitHub security advisory GHSA-q4gg-4fxq-mwg8.


